      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "仅为虚构文本。请用当前只读audit函数检查下列内嵌TeX（可用python -B导入函数并传字符串，无需写文件），汇报相关候选及起止源行、是否仍把注释/引用键里的attribute和record当正文。真实操作已确认：编码器按过程变量分别编码，工序汇总特征通过学习权重相加后供分类；offline assay确指实验室化验。只给一条必要的局部原句→改句及中文理由，不机械替换variable-wise或删除合法offline，不改数字/方法/原文件，不把候选判成禁词。源文本：\n```tex\n% Legacy records: attributes and variable-specific features.\n\\begin{abstract}\nA shared encoder extracts variable-wise\nfeatures from process measurements.\nUnit summaries support information\nexchange before classification.\n\\end{abstract}\n\nOffline assay measurements supply training targets.\n\\cite{attributes,records}\\label{offline}\n```",
